✖︎ Resolver `Query.shadow_page` is selected in an @exec_time_resolvers operation, but its @rootFragment `QueryShadowPageResolverFragment` reaches the client-to-server edge `ClientThing.server_page` (`@waterfall`). At exec time the executor evaluates this root fragment where it cannot send network requests, so it cannot fetch the edge. Select `ClientThing.server_page` with `@waterfall` in the query or fragment that reads `shadow_page`, and use its server data there or in a resolver on its server type; or read `shadow_page` in an operation without @exec_time_resolvers.

